# The upload store in development (welfare evidence, visitor photographs, signage media) — moved out
# of wwwroot on 2026-09-15. Never commit it. The wwwroot/uploads rule above did not stop five
# dev-tenant uploads from being tracked: they were in the 2026-08-25 baseline snapshot, before the
# rule existed, and only a `git rm` removes an already-tracked file.
